<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Uromed.  [CORRECTED]</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman starts Uromed.  [CORRECTED]</headline>
<text>
<p>- Goldman Sachs said it initiated coverage of Uromed Corp with  a market outperform (corrects rating from perform) rating.</p>
<p>- Further details were not available.</p>
<p>- Uromed's stock gained 3/8 to 10.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
